# `npm run eval` writes here. Already in .gitignore, which prettier does not read
# — without this line, every developer who runs the evaluation fails
# `format:check` on their own untracked artifacts.
eval-reports

# Markdown is left alone on purpose. The docs are hand-wrapped at 80 columns and
# read as prose; letting a formatter reflow them produces enormous diffs that
# bury the one sentence that actually changed.
*.md

# Note on the narrator's prose in lib/prompts/ and lib/story-bibles/: it is NOT
# ignored, because prettier does not touch the inside of a template literal —
# verified before this file was written. If you ever add a plugin that does,
# ignore those two directories, because re-wrapping that text changes what the
# model reads and what a child hears.
